              "glyph of warding:explosive-runes-damage:dice-per-slot:choice:glyph-of-warding:mode:explosive-runes",
              "glyph of warding:stored-spell-level-threshold:selected-slot-value:min-4:choice:glyph-of-warding:mode:spell-glyph",
            ],
            "sourcePage": 149,
            "sourcePhrase": "When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage of an explosive runes glyph increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd. If you create a spell glyph, you can store any spell of up to the same level as the slot you use for the glyph of warding.",
          },
        ],
        "spellName": "Glyph of Warding",
        "spellRef": "spell:glyph-of-warding",
      },
